            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Установи атрибут <code>width</code> спрайта на <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>width</code>, затем <code>=</code>, и наконец <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Выбери правильный тег для изображения спрайта.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/sword.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>&lt;img</code>, затем <code>src=</code>, а затем <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/sword.png\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
